WEBVTT

00:02.150 --> 00:03.700
Possession necromancy!

00:05.190 --> 00:08.190
<b>Using 2 soma drops
Mana level 1 → 7</b>

00:05.190 --> 00:08.190
Back to this stupid body, huh?

00:08.190 --> 00:11.420
I'm just glad you're out of mine! 
That was disgusting.

00:11.420 --> 00:14.080
We were doing just fine that way, though!

00:14.080 --> 00:16.850
Forcing me out could've cost me
the ability to see you.

00:16.850 --> 00:19.120
But it didn't, so who cares?

00:19.120 --> 00:21.700
Er, might I ask to whom you're speaking?

00:21.700 --> 00:24.880
Huh? Oh, Yuna's right there.

00:27.460 --> 00:29.930
Dame Yuna! Whatever happened to you?!

00:29.930 --> 00:32.470
But I recognize that jawline! 
It's definitely her!

00:32.470 --> 00:33.510
How is that me?!

00:33.510 --> 00:36.040
I'm talking about Yuna's <i>consciousness</i>.

00:36.040 --> 00:38.110
An astral projection of it.

00:38.110 --> 00:39.410
Her consciousness?

00:39.410 --> 00:42.920
I dunno how it happened,
but since leaving the memory world,

00:42.920 --> 00:44.520
I've been able to see her.

00:45.740 --> 00:46.940
Mana sight!

00:48.100 --> 00:51.210
Ah, so that there is 
Dame Yuna's consciousness?

00:51.210 --> 00:57.350
Perhaps your prolonged possession of her body
has forged a connection between your souls.

00:57.350 --> 00:58.390
We're connected?

00:58.390 --> 00:59.280
Indeed.

00:59.680 --> 01:01.560
I can see the mana threads.

01:01.980 --> 01:05.850
The reason you dragged Dame Yuna
 into the world of your memories,

01:05.850 --> 01:07.670
and the reason you can see her now,

01:07.670 --> 01:10.840
must be due to this connection between you.

01:12.240 --> 01:14.130
She says we've got a connection!

01:14.130 --> 01:16.050
Which I find pretty creepy. Don't you?

01:16.050 --> 01:18.710
But what do we do with my sister's body?

01:18.710 --> 01:20.490
If Papa finds her like this...

01:20.910 --> 01:23.770
I certainly don't want you
possessing me anymore!

01:23.770 --> 01:25.310
Fine, I get it.

01:25.680 --> 01:28.730
Let's tie her up and hide her 
in the trunk in the enchanted carriage.

01:29.210 --> 01:32.810
If we tell him she went back to the village 
or something, he'll probably buy it.

01:32.810 --> 01:35.070
I don't think I will.

01:38.370 --> 01:40.420
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

01:42.060 --> 01:44.240
Dead, dead, another day dead

01:44.240 --> 01:46.170
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

01:46.170 --> 01:48.300
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

01:48.300 --> 01:51.050
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

01:50.180 --> 01:51.070
<b>THE</b>

01:51.070 --> 01:51.610
<b>LEGEN</b>

01:51.610 --> 01:52.110
<b>DARY</b>

01:52.110 --> 01:52.570
<b>HERO</b>

01:52.570 --> 01:53.070
<b>IS</b>

01:53.030 --> 01:53.530
<b>DEAD</b>

01:57.900 --> 01:59.570
Spending every day like 
you're in a casket, trapped

01:59.570 --> 02:01.640
Ready for another night 
like the dead, collapsed

02:01.640 --> 02:03.390
Yeah, living like a carcass
 with just your "life" intact...

02:03.390 --> 02:05.680
Who wouldn't want a way 
to con themselves out of that?

02:05.680 --> 02:07.770
Breaking away from ideas of "should do"

02:07.770 --> 02:09.690
to live for yourself—
that's lots of fun, too...

02:09.690 --> 02:11.620
Otherwise you're just being a mark...

02:11.620 --> 02:12.730
And who wants that?

02:12.730 --> 02:16.240
You and I, we're just corpses

02:16.240 --> 02:20.510
Pawns of some faceless necromancer

02:20.510 --> 02:24.250
From one marionette to another, I say...

02:24.250 --> 02:30.420
How about we cut our strings together?

02:30.420 --> 02:31.220
Let's get dancing!

02:31.220 --> 02:33.260
Dead, dead, another day dead

02:33.260 --> 02:35.330
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

02:35.330 --> 02:37.350
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

02:37.350 --> 02:39.180
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

02:39.180 --> 02:41.240
Dead, dead, we're already dead

02:41.240 --> 02:43.270
Gonna shake off this 
mortal coil any minute now

02:43.270 --> 02:45.230
You just gotta laugh a life like this off!

02:45.230 --> 02:47.730
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

02:47.730 --> 02:51.570
I tell you, this world makes life so hard

02:51.570 --> 02:55.450
What can you do but dance 
the whole night through?

02:55.450 --> 02:58.710
Even if I collapse and my body decays

02:58.710 --> 03:03.490
that doesn't mean I'm rotten 
all the way down to my soul!

03:07.490 --> 03:10.960
<b>Episode 10</b>

03:07.490 --> 03:10.960
<b>The Raid of the Legendary Hero</b>

03:08.270 --> 03:10.550
<i>When I was placed in charge of this city,</i>

03:10.550 --> 03:12.920
<i>I decided to use it to enhance my personal wealth.</i>

03:12.920 --> 03:16.700
<i>I built the facilities that the city lacked,</i>

03:16.700 --> 03:20.880
<i>so that when the time came,
I could make even more money!</i>

03:20.880 --> 03:22.000
<i>However...</i>

03:22.000 --> 03:25.850
<i>At some point, the citizens 
began to respect me!</i>

03:26.310 --> 03:29.180
<i>It was a pretty nice feeling!</i>

03:29.180 --> 03:31.020
Mayor!

03:33.040 --> 03:35.370
We've arrived at the capital.

03:36.150 --> 03:39.030
Only thirteen or fourteen hours remain.

03:39.410 --> 03:42.610
Even if we inform His Majesty, 
it may be too late.

03:43.570 --> 03:44.740
What troubles you?

03:45.060 --> 03:48.700
I've been such a fool.

03:49.580 --> 03:54.190
Diego, you need to stop sending 
in assassins haphazardly.

03:54.190 --> 03:55.710
Ethel betrayed us.

03:55.710 --> 03:59.810
Nefu has been slain,
 his magic crystal likely taken.

03:59.810 --> 04:02.500
Everything you do just 
makes them more powerful.

04:02.500 --> 04:06.320
Come now, don't tell me
you're losing your nerve.

04:06.320 --> 04:08.870
I can see your nose running there.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.470
You know that's unrelated.

04:10.470 --> 04:17.060
You know I'll win in the end, 
no matter how powerful our foe may be.

04:21.870 --> 04:23.640
Damn, I missed!

04:23.640 --> 04:24.990
Excellent timing.

04:24.990 --> 04:28.230
I'll use these fools as a demonstration.

04:28.230 --> 04:31.720
That should stop your 
nose from running, right?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.710
You know that's unrelated.

04:34.310 --> 04:37.120
A type of clairvoyance
to see through the eyes of another?

04:37.120 --> 04:38.050
Yes.

04:38.050 --> 04:42.420
It appears the Order of Magical Warriors 
has engaged the necromancers.

04:43.280 --> 04:45.340
It's over, necromancer!

04:45.760 --> 04:47.730
That was too easy.

04:47.730 --> 04:49.850
If you want to beg for your life, 
now's the time.

04:51.730 --> 04:53.770
There's one down!

04:54.620 --> 04:56.980
The ability to regenerate 
from decapitation?

04:56.980 --> 04:58.820
It's almost like...

04:58.820 --> 05:02.030
Yes, the power of the Infernal Generals.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.980
By using one of their bodies, 
preserved here, like a magic crystal,

05:04.980 --> 05:09.040
I have an Infernal General's
regenerative power at my disposal!

05:09.910 --> 05:11.450
Thanks for the explanation.

05:15.210 --> 05:19.120
The blood magic doesn't come 
from the Infernal General, though.

05:20.170 --> 05:21.130
Commander!

05:21.880 --> 05:24.630
We don't have time to deal with peons,

05:24.630 --> 05:26.550
you snot-nosed bastard!

05:29.230 --> 05:30.260
How?!

05:30.260 --> 05:31.930
What just happened?!

05:31.930 --> 05:33.980
That was too easy.

05:33.980 --> 05:36.640
If you want to beg for your life, 
now's the time.

05:38.770 --> 05:40.780
P-Please spare me.

05:40.780 --> 05:42.630
I'll do anything you ask!

05:44.860 --> 05:47.130
Still trying to beat me?

05:47.130 --> 05:48.530
You've got me in tears.

05:49.250 --> 05:52.950
In honor of your bravery, 
I'll show you my full power.

05:53.740 --> 05:55.720
Remote necromancy.

05:57.810 --> 06:01.170
Infernal General Vertex!

06:01.530 --> 06:02.800
Now...

06:02.800 --> 06:06.260
Cry lots of tears for me as you perish.

06:07.030 --> 06:10.390
Damn it, stay back! Stay back!

06:13.380 --> 06:15.680
My Order of Magical Warriors...

06:15.680 --> 06:17.660
The Infernal Generals...

06:18.230 --> 06:22.110
I never expected to see them 
oppose us even in death.

06:22.110 --> 06:25.330
If our enemy attacked the capital 
with power like that,

06:25.330 --> 06:27.740
we would never survive.

06:27.740 --> 06:29.770
Then we shall strike first!

06:29.770 --> 06:33.050
Muster a fighting force 
and sortie to Elvania!

06:33.050 --> 06:35.200
We will stop them before they can start!

06:35.200 --> 06:37.700
Your Majesty! You must sortie at once!

06:37.700 --> 06:39.420
There's no time to waste!

06:39.420 --> 06:43.460
Who goes there? The mayor of Moaran
and Twin-Spear Belarco?

06:43.460 --> 06:45.580
Twin-Spear Belarco?

06:45.580 --> 06:48.230
He's the man who slew
a hundred devils at once!

06:48.230 --> 06:52.300
I heard it was a hundred <i>high-rank</i> devils!

06:52.300 --> 06:54.890
Why say you there's no time to waste?

06:54.890 --> 06:57.630
A devil in the necromancers' service

06:57.630 --> 07:01.480
is on the verge of turning 
the people of Moaran into devils!

07:01.480 --> 07:04.190
We barely have twelve hours left!

07:04.190 --> 07:06.500
The legendary hero is doing his best,

07:06.500 --> 07:09.260
but Elvania is overrun by devils,

07:09.260 --> 07:11.070
and his party alone stands little chance.

07:11.070 --> 07:14.750
But it will take days to gather
 a proper fighting force.

07:14.750 --> 07:16.240
Regardless, you must act!

07:16.240 --> 07:19.460
If only companions of the legendary hero...

07:19.460 --> 07:20.870
I beg of you!

07:20.870 --> 07:22.100
I'll do whatever it takes!

07:22.100 --> 07:23.960
Money is no object for me!

07:23.960 --> 07:26.710
Please, save my citizens!

07:26.710 --> 07:28.570
Although I'm their mayor,

07:28.570 --> 07:32.680
I'm a terrible person who's only thought 
about myself and my own profits!

07:32.680 --> 07:38.010
Yet, in spite of that,
my citizens still respected me.

07:38.520 --> 07:41.320
And I've finally come to realize...

07:41.730 --> 07:44.920
I really care about them!

07:44.920 --> 07:47.690
They're a true treasure I don't want to lose!

07:47.690 --> 07:48.760
I beseech you too.

07:48.760 --> 07:49.910
Belarco!

07:50.530 --> 07:51.610
And the horse!

07:51.610 --> 07:53.300
Rise, Dott Burns.

07:53.780 --> 07:57.490
Your Majesty, permit me to mobilize 
the Knights and our enchanted ship.

07:57.490 --> 08:01.540
But against an enemy so powerful
that even Belarco requests aid,

08:01.540 --> 08:03.830
even if we send the Knights...

08:03.830 --> 08:06.210
Not just the Knights.

08:06.210 --> 08:08.190
I'm going to ask for <i>his</i> help as well.

08:09.040 --> 08:11.570
Who in the world are we going to meet?

08:11.570 --> 08:15.450
I found him walking naked through the capital
 a few days ago and arrested him.

08:15.450 --> 08:17.010
He was streaking?!

08:17.450 --> 08:18.960
I see...

08:18.960 --> 08:21.980
I understand why you'd request my aid.

08:22.470 --> 08:24.670
With Sion gone,

08:24.670 --> 08:27.460
I'm now the world's most superior specimen.

08:27.360 --> 08:31.940
<b>Kyle Ozment
Former Companion of the Hero; "Pinnacle of Humanity"</b>

08:27.880 --> 08:31.240
The very pinnacle of humanity.

08:32.490 --> 08:38.660
Part of the reason this happened was that
I left Yuna behind to go on my journey.

08:38.660 --> 08:40.760
So I'll forgive you.

08:40.760 --> 08:41.620
But...

08:42.120 --> 08:45.210
Only if you agree to convert 
to the Church of Tits!

08:45.210 --> 08:46.740
Tits rule, man!

08:46.740 --> 08:48.920
That's right! Tits <i>do</i> rule!

08:49.740 --> 08:51.920
<i>Touka, can you hear me?</i>

08:51.920 --> 08:53.760
This is Marguerite.

08:53.760 --> 08:56.220
<i>Wow, I can totally hear you!</i>

08:56.220 --> 09:00.300
That magical transceiver 
I built is impressive, eh?

09:00.300 --> 09:04.310
It should let you communicate 
all through the Elvanian area.

09:04.310 --> 09:05.910
And...

09:05.910 --> 09:09.440
I pity that poor girl, 
having to stand around naked...

09:09.440 --> 09:12.440
Just put this on her real body.

09:12.440 --> 09:16.430
Clothing made from devil hide
 transmits via mana.

09:16.430 --> 09:19.340
It should project onto her astral form too.

09:20.830 --> 09:24.110
Well, it's better than 
being naked, at least,

09:24.110 --> 09:25.950
but it's a bit on the fetishy side...

09:26.370 --> 09:29.110
Nah, it looks great on you!

09:29.110 --> 09:31.170
You've got great taste, old man!

09:32.150 --> 09:34.550
You've been a huge help with everything.

09:34.550 --> 09:38.010
Oh, please. I'd do anything for my grandson.

09:38.010 --> 09:40.290
But we told you all about that.

09:40.290 --> 09:42.000
Sion is—

09:42.000 --> 09:44.070
Oh, I know what's going on.

09:44.070 --> 09:46.820
Touka! It's time to move out!

09:46.820 --> 09:48.270
R-Right!

09:48.270 --> 09:52.570
By the way, how did he know I was naked?

09:52.570 --> 09:54.730
<i>My vision may be failing me,</i>

09:54.730 --> 09:58.530
<i>but in exchange, I've gained 
the ability to see mana and souls.</i>

09:58.530 --> 10:01.990
<i>Keep them safe, Sion.</i>

10:01.990 --> 10:03.960
You really going?

10:03.960 --> 10:05.770
I warned you, though.

10:05.770 --> 10:07.670
Don't blame me if things go south.

10:07.670 --> 10:08.580
Yeah.

10:08.580 --> 10:11.460
I promised we'd go our 
separate ways here, Master.

10:11.460 --> 10:15.260
<i>Sheesh. Touka's got such 
a soft spot for me.</i>

10:15.260 --> 10:17.870
<i>Even so, we're still enemies.</i>

10:17.870 --> 10:19.780
<i>It's time to harden my heart and—</i>

10:19.780 --> 10:21.430
Okay, heading out!

10:23.680 --> 10:25.640
Hey!

10:25.640 --> 10:29.050
Touka! How could you just 
leave without a word?!

10:29.050 --> 10:30.780
Got me a master!

10:31.200 --> 10:35.310
C'mon, despite what you say, 
I know you've got a soft spot for me.

10:35.310 --> 10:38.130
I figured if I left like that, 
you'd worry I didn't like you

10:38.130 --> 10:39.740
and come running after me!

10:39.740 --> 10:41.280
Looks like I was right!

10:41.280 --> 10:43.250
Y-You...

10:43.250 --> 10:46.520
So it's time to pick your poison.

10:46.520 --> 10:50.660
What'll it be? You wanna do this 
as our ally, or as a <i>hostage</i>?

10:50.660 --> 10:52.460
D-Damn you...

10:52.460 --> 10:54.530
You shitty student!

10:54.530 --> 10:56.670
The shittiest!

10:58.690 --> 11:02.650
Isaac, you didn't have to come with us.

10:59.680 --> 11:03.100
<b>Enchanted Ship of the Farom Knighthood
Naglfar</b>

11:03.100 --> 11:06.780
I'm sorry. I couldn't stop 
worrying about Her Highness!

11:06.780 --> 11:09.690
I can't believe you helped her 
run away like that.

11:09.690 --> 11:11.060
Honestly...

11:14.150 --> 11:20.110
Fancy running into a man who couldn't 
even beat a mid-rank devil here.

11:20.110 --> 11:22.910
You seem awfully confident, Kyle Ozment.

11:22.910 --> 11:26.260
We're going up against the Four 
Infernal Generals, you know.

11:26.260 --> 11:28.520
But the legendary hero will be there, yes?

11:28.520 --> 11:30.330
I see nothing to worry about.

11:30.330 --> 11:31.850
But that legendary hero is—

11:31.850 --> 11:33.380
Touka, isn't he?

11:33.380 --> 11:35.460
You... You knew about that?!

11:36.340 --> 11:39.770
<i>I'll kill Touka and become Sion the hero.</i>

11:39.770 --> 11:40.840
<i>And then...</i>

11:40.840 --> 11:47.310
<i>I'll slay Anri, the other necromancers, 
and the Four Infernal Generals all by myself!</i>

11:48.870 --> 11:50.270
Almost there, right?

11:50.270 --> 11:53.770
Touka, do you know why 
I became a legendary hero?

11:53.770 --> 11:56.110
Huh? Where's this coming from?

11:56.410 --> 12:02.200
I did it because I have a dream of creating 
a peaceful world and restoring Elvania.

12:02.620 --> 12:03.890
I want...

12:03.890 --> 12:06.660
to take back those days we spent in Elvania!

12:09.070 --> 12:11.890
Then I guess we're gonna need Yuna.

12:11.890 --> 12:13.620
Yeah, totally!

12:14.330 --> 12:17.090
Elvania's nearly in sight. Get ready.

12:17.090 --> 12:20.050
Master... You're really gonna help us?

12:20.050 --> 12:23.990
I've never been pleased 
about Diego's methods.

12:23.990 --> 12:28.440
I hear you! You just love your student 
so much, you can't help yourself!

12:28.440 --> 12:30.020
Listen to the words I say!

12:30.020 --> 12:35.060
Now then... it's safe to assume 
Titty Devil is in those ruins, right?

12:35.060 --> 12:36.060
Yeah.

12:36.060 --> 12:38.690
That's their home base, after all.

12:38.690 --> 12:41.450
Then let's do this like we planned, Master.

12:41.450 --> 12:43.380
You too, Anri. Get the timing just right.

12:43.380 --> 12:44.030
Indeed!

12:47.820 --> 12:49.740
I'll shield us with the Sacred Sword!

12:49.740 --> 12:51.790
Shannon, use the X-ray crystal!

13:01.590 --> 13:03.920
Welcome, legendary hero and company!

13:03.920 --> 13:06.300
I'm impressed you made it this far!

13:06.300 --> 13:08.220
<i>The Bloody Tears jerk...</i>

13:08.220 --> 13:10.770
I appreciate the lavish welcome.

13:10.770 --> 13:14.570
Only the best for my favorite playmate!

13:14.570 --> 13:16.730
But you'd better show me a hell of a time!

13:16.730 --> 13:19.310
Hah! That's my line—

13:22.280 --> 13:24.030
Even an invincible zombie can be slain

13:24.030 --> 13:28.490
if you destroy the soul 
with a mana-infused weapon.

13:29.050 --> 13:30.640
Sorry, Touka.

13:30.640 --> 13:33.950
As your master, I felt 
an obligation to kill you myself.

13:33.950 --> 13:36.170
You didn't betray us after all?

13:36.170 --> 13:38.580
I was just waiting for my chance.

13:38.580 --> 13:40.930
If you doubt me, 
see for yourself with mana sight.

13:40.930 --> 13:43.920
Touka's soul has been completely destroyed.

13:45.310 --> 13:47.470
Well, you're right about that...

13:48.920 --> 13:51.070
You really had me fooled!

13:51.070 --> 13:53.490
I'd expect no less from
the woman who betrayed humanity.

13:53.490 --> 13:56.500
You didn't even hesitate 
to kill your own student!

13:56.500 --> 14:01.470
Still, it's a shame to see such a highly
 anticipated game ended so quickly.

14:01.470 --> 14:03.190
So very sorry.

14:04.060 --> 14:06.240
You can play however you like with the rest.

14:06.240 --> 14:10.740
I'm going to hand the body 
over to Mr. Snot-Nose.

14:11.290 --> 14:15.500
<i>Now the rest is up to you, Touka...</i>

14:16.330 --> 14:18.080
Infiltration complete!

14:18.560 --> 14:21.910
Now I get how that Bloody Tears jerk survived

14:21.910 --> 14:24.550
even after I killed 
the devil he was possessing.

14:24.850 --> 14:29.180
If Anri calls off her possession necromancy 
the instant before the attack hits,

14:29.180 --> 14:31.090
I can bail out before dying.

14:31.390 --> 14:37.060
And when that jerk sees the empty shell
of a corpse, he'll naturally assume I'm toast.

14:37.060 --> 14:40.820
And Elvania here is our home turf.

14:40.820 --> 14:43.180
I know this city from top to bottom.

14:43.180 --> 14:44.830
If we follow this sewer—

14:45.280 --> 14:47.860
Sir Touka! I wish to accompany you!

14:47.860 --> 14:49.230
Accompany me?

14:49.230 --> 14:52.270
They're gonna get suspicious 
if they don't see you up there!

14:52.270 --> 14:53.450
It's all right.

14:53.860 --> 14:55.610
I left a duplicate.

14:55.910 --> 14:59.060
And even if they do notice, they won't care.

14:59.060 --> 15:03.010
Any infiltration I run by myself 
is doomed to end in failure,

15:03.010 --> 15:06.310
since I'm considered a failure 
among necromancers.

15:06.310 --> 15:07.760
But even so...

15:07.760 --> 15:10.340
I believe I can be of help to you, Sir Touka.

15:12.600 --> 15:15.810
Darn it. Guess I can't stop you, then.

15:15.810 --> 15:20.010
This'll be our first fight as a trio 
since we threw down with Kyle.

15:20.010 --> 15:24.150
So you truly can use the Sacred Sword 
even in your original body?

15:24.150 --> 15:25.340
Yup.

15:25.340 --> 15:28.740
Maybe it really did choose me after all.

15:28.740 --> 15:31.170
Indeed! Surely it must be so!

15:31.170 --> 15:34.700
You've become a legendary hero 
to surpass the legendary hero!

15:36.540 --> 15:41.620
Gotta say... this body's way more 
out of shape than Sion's or Yuna's!

15:41.620 --> 15:44.180
Maybe that's your cue 
to work out a little more?

15:44.180 --> 15:47.380
I don't need big guns to live the slow life!

15:47.380 --> 15:48.960
And hey, are you floating?!

15:49.400 --> 15:51.200
Sir Touka! The ruins!

15:54.660 --> 15:55.860
Now...

15:55.860 --> 15:58.030
Time to find Titty Devil and—

15:58.560 --> 16:00.140
Touka?

15:58.560 --> 16:00.140
Sir Touka?!

16:00.140 --> 16:02.930
Y-Yeah, haven't been 
in this body for a while...

16:02.930 --> 16:04.870
I just lost my balance.

16:05.590 --> 16:07.210
<i>My nose is bleeding.</i>

16:07.210 --> 16:09.240
<i>My head's pounding, too.</i>

16:09.240 --> 16:12.430
<i>Is it from using possession 
necromancy too many times?</i>

16:12.430 --> 16:17.200
<i>Or maybe I shouldn't have 
used so many soma drops...</i>

16:17.200 --> 16:18.250
<i>Whatever.</i>

16:18.250 --> 16:20.450
<i>This isn't so bad that I can't endure it.</i>

16:20.450 --> 16:23.220
<i>I can't afford to fall apart
 until I save Yuna.</i>

16:23.220 --> 16:25.420
Did you hear something?

16:26.490 --> 16:27.420
<i>Not good!</i>

16:27.420 --> 16:28.920
<i>Form Change!</i>

16:31.920 --> 16:33.830
Oh, it's a radish.

16:33.830 --> 16:35.750
Yeah, a pretty big radish.

16:35.750 --> 16:37.890
Why did you go with a radish?

16:37.890 --> 16:40.980
What's a giant radish doing here?

16:40.980 --> 16:43.100
Suspicious. Let's investigate.

16:45.650 --> 16:47.780
Guess the stealth part of the mission's over.

16:47.780 --> 16:49.770
Anri, you're up.

16:50.170 --> 16:54.490
<i>If we possess low-rank devils, 
we can infiltrate and gather info easy.</i>

16:54.490 --> 16:57.030
<i>We can stash my body 
in the Coffin of the Living,</i>

16:57.030 --> 17:00.720
<i>and carry you around
as a "captured intruder."</i>

17:02.180 --> 17:05.120
Those people... They're going to be killed!

17:05.480 --> 17:08.950
But if we pick a fight, 
it'll blow our cover!

17:08.950 --> 17:10.040
Indeed!

17:11.150 --> 17:12.450
Attention, everyone!

17:12.450 --> 17:15.000
The hero's party is attacking!

17:15.000 --> 17:17.080
You've got to get into the city and fight!

17:17.080 --> 17:17.900
Shaddap!

17:17.900 --> 17:20.060
We don't take orders from low-rank devils!

17:20.060 --> 17:23.060
Get outta here! We do what we want!

17:24.030 --> 17:26.940
Sir Touka... They yelled at me.

17:26.940 --> 17:30.480
Got it. If they won't listen 
to a low-rank devil...

17:30.480 --> 17:34.510
Boobs... Boobs...

17:34.510 --> 17:36.290
P-Please spare us!

17:36.290 --> 17:37.280
Hold it!

17:37.280 --> 17:40.300
I'm the wandering high-rank devil, Tou—

17:40.300 --> 17:41.450
Er, Tuuka!

17:41.450 --> 17:43.160
You stay out of this!

17:43.160 --> 17:45.960
I love watching humans get tormented.

17:45.960 --> 17:47.920
So I totally get you.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.260
What? You do?

17:49.260 --> 17:50.510
Of course not!

17:50.510 --> 17:52.600
I've been studying human culture,

17:52.600 --> 17:56.880
and I've learned a way to increase 
our enjoyment of them 120 percent!

17:56.880 --> 17:58.630
A hundred and twenty percent?!

17:58.630 --> 18:00.630
Awesome!

18:00.630 --> 18:03.350
Don't worry. I'm actually human.

18:03.350 --> 18:07.010
I wanna save you right away, 
but I can't afford to cause a commotion.

18:07.010 --> 18:09.200
Buy us some time, would you?

18:09.200 --> 18:11.000
Put these on.

18:11.310 --> 18:14.050
I've learned something on my travels!

18:14.050 --> 18:16.300
We devils are all pervs!

18:16.300 --> 18:20.040
The way to increase enjoyment 
of human women by 120 percent...

18:20.040 --> 18:21.280
is to...

18:21.280 --> 18:23.240
get 'em naked in stockings!

18:23.240 --> 18:25.620
You are one miserable creep.

18:25.620 --> 18:27.890
There's plenty more we can get out of 'em!

18:27.890 --> 18:31.080
When I return,
I'll show you lots more awesome stuff!

18:31.080 --> 18:33.420
Be back to save you later!

18:34.710 --> 18:37.130
Mr. Tuuka! Wait a minute!

18:37.130 --> 18:39.500
We were so moved by what you did!

18:39.500 --> 18:42.730
Ever since Diego showed up, 
under his influence,

18:42.730 --> 18:45.850
they've come to enjoy 
the most awful tortures!

18:45.850 --> 18:51.040
Even though our queen taught us that
just because humans are food,

18:51.040 --> 18:53.310
we don't have to torment them unnecessarily!

18:53.310 --> 18:54.770
Your queen?

18:54.770 --> 18:58.880
But you cured them of their 
thirst for blood in an instant!

18:58.880 --> 19:00.350
I bet you can save her!

19:00.350 --> 19:03.950
Save our queen, Lady Adele,
 from Diego's control!

19:03.950 --> 19:08.570
Wait, ain't she the one behind
turning those humans into devils?

19:08.570 --> 19:11.920
Yes! That's our splendid queen!

19:14.340 --> 19:16.960
<i>Found you, Titty Devil!</i>

19:16.960 --> 19:19.550
We're down to an hour and a half.

19:19.550 --> 19:22.560
If she gets away and summons allies,
we're doomed!

19:22.560 --> 19:24.400
We've got to do this in one strike.

19:24.400 --> 19:25.500
No problem.

19:25.500 --> 19:27.740
We'll put her to sleep and do it for sure.

19:27.740 --> 19:28.930
Put her to sleep?

19:28.930 --> 19:32.890
<i>Master said Nefu's spell 
lets you put anyone to sleep</i>

19:32.890 --> 19:36.020
<i>if you touch their head 
and say the magic word.</i>

19:36.020 --> 19:39.410
<i>But it won't work 
if they've got their guard up.</i>

19:39.410 --> 19:41.400
<i>So I need her to let hers down.</i>

19:41.400 --> 19:42.860
Who are you?

19:42.860 --> 19:44.580
I'm Tuuka!

19:44.580 --> 19:49.200
I'm a wandering high-rank devil, 
drawn here by belief in your ideals!

19:49.200 --> 19:53.890
To turn half of humanity into devils 
and the other half into cattle,

19:53.890 --> 19:57.150
creating a world in which humans 
and devils live in harmony...

19:57.150 --> 19:59.160
Is that the ideal you speak of?

19:59.160 --> 20:03.930
Mr. Tuuka cured the others 
of their madness in an instant!

20:04.890 --> 20:08.430
Let's work with him 
to achieve our ideal world!

20:08.430 --> 20:11.100
If Diego kills all the humans,

20:11.100 --> 20:13.260
we have no future!

20:13.260 --> 20:15.480
Our ideal world...

20:15.480 --> 20:20.240
But turning on Lord Diego will see 
many of our own kind purged.

20:21.030 --> 20:23.670
Then we should convince Diego, too!

20:23.670 --> 20:25.570
I'll help you do it.

20:25.920 --> 20:28.810
I know humans better than anyone.

20:28.810 --> 20:33.160
If we talk to Diego together, 
he'll understand.

20:33.160 --> 20:36.120
I believe destiny has brought us together.

20:36.120 --> 20:40.070
I was born to help you realize 
your ideal world with you.

20:40.500 --> 20:41.870
Oh, I know!

20:41.870 --> 20:43.090
There's a human custom

20:43.090 --> 20:48.070
where you touch each other's
foreheads as a sign of friendship.

20:48.070 --> 20:49.560
Touch each other's foreheads?

20:49.560 --> 20:53.330
Yeah. The head houses the soul, no?

20:53.330 --> 20:55.140
It indicates a linking of souls.

20:55.140 --> 20:59.400
In other words, our two hearts 
forming a connection.

20:59.400 --> 21:01.180
That's a lovely custom.

21:01.180 --> 21:03.360
First I've heard of it, though.

21:03.360 --> 21:05.590
Now, place your finger here.

21:05.590 --> 21:09.180
We're comrades striving for the same ideal.

21:09.180 --> 21:10.700
I thank you.

21:10.700 --> 21:13.040
I'm so glad I met you.

21:14.950 --> 21:16.000
<i>I win!</i>

21:16.000 --> 21:17.160
Lady Adele?!

21:17.160 --> 21:18.970
Mr. Tuuka, what happened?!

21:18.970 --> 21:20.880
I put her to sleep with a spell!

21:22.310 --> 21:24.380
I was a necromancer the whole time!

21:24.380 --> 21:27.060
And I'm actually a human inside!

21:27.060 --> 21:29.510
Titty Devil dies here and now!

21:29.510 --> 21:31.830
You ain't never gettin' your ideal world!

21:31.830 --> 21:33.350
Sucks for you!

21:33.350 --> 21:36.760
<i>Why does Touka sound like the villain here?!</i>

21:37.900 --> 21:39.610
Time to end this!

21:42.170 --> 21:42.820
Crap!

21:42.820 --> 21:44.580
Quick, Anri! Return me!

21:47.360 --> 21:49.370
That was a close call...

21:53.890 --> 21:54.910
Anri?

21:55.270 --> 21:57.800
You're... still alive?

22:01.610 --> 22:03.960
It's been a long time, Anri.

22:03.960 --> 22:06.970
Yes, it has... Brother.

22:06.970 --> 22:09.950
<b>1 hour and 10 minutes until Yuna and the others become devils</b>

22:09.950 --> 22:21.060
<b>Next Time</b>

22:10.250 --> 22:12.850
"Fine, just for you..."

22:11.030 --> 22:21.060
<b>The Legendary Hero Fights to the Death!</b>

22:12.850 --> 22:15.880
Honey Honey Honey Honey

22:15.880 --> 22:20.250
Hi, Honey Honey Trap Trap

22:21.400 --> 22:26.540
Hey, I've got a melty marshmallow secret

22:27.870 --> 22:31.740
It's just bursting with sugar, you know...

22:31.740 --> 22:37.060
Hey, I know you want a taste... don't you?

22:38.150 --> 22:42.090
Don't bother to hide it, it's clear as day...

22:42.090 --> 22:44.840
Come a little closer, now

22:44.840 --> 22:48.900
A fleeting glimpse of lusty pink

22:48.900 --> 22:52.010
A seductive voice with a hint of danger

22:52.010 --> 22:57.600
See? I've already got you under my spell...

23:00.650 --> 23:04.120
It's a true-true-true hazard to pursue

23:04.120 --> 23:07.900
This sweetest trap of romance

23:07.900 --> 23:10.710
So cu-cu-cu-cute how you'll fall in love...

23:10.710 --> 23:13.620
In this literal pit I dug!

23:14.510 --> 23:17.750
You can't shoo-shoo-shoo me 
away when I pursue

23:17.750 --> 23:21.610
Such intense romance needs a strategy

23:21.610 --> 23:25.780
I'll kee-kee-kee-keep on 
setting bait every day...

23:26.500 --> 23:28.300
In my honey trap

23:28.300 --> 23:31.290
Honey Honey Honey Honey

23:31.290 --> 23:35.620
Hi, Honey Honey Trap Trap
